    "raw-stream hashes identical across all arms of a scenario/seed",
    "smoke arms cover every new code path (atc, doc, enscal, ddm, adwin, replay) under own-transformer raw mode"
  ],
  "smoke_arms": ["bh_ps_zero_atc_2000", "bh_ton_full_doc_2000", "bh_ps_full_enscal_2000",
